{"id":1084,"path":"/grammar-points/b1/third-conditional-past-unreal-situations/","parentId":341,"order":180,"section":"grammar-points","level":"b1","depth":3,"title":"Third conditional: Past unreal situations","seo":{"title":"Third conditional: Past unreal situations - Test-English","description":"Master the third conditional to talk about past unreal situations in this B1 Intermediate grammar lesson. Clear rules, charts and exercises!","image":"/media/uploads/B1%E2%80%93Third-conditional.png"},"modified":"2026-03-01T09:37:18","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct form to make third conditional sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"235\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct form&nbsp;to make third conditional sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"236\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with&nbsp;the&nbsp;verbs in brackets in the correct form to make third conditional sentences with <em>would</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"237\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>Third conditional: Grammar Chart</h2> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-33019\" src=\"/media/uploads/third-conditional.new_.png\" alt=\"Third conditional grammar chart explaining sentence structure for past hypothetical situations with examples like &quot;If you had come to class, you would have passed the exam.&quot;\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2><strong>If</strong> clause and main clause</h2> <p>We use the <a href=\"/grammar-points/a2/past-perfect/\"><strong>past perfect</strong></a> in the <strong>if</strong>-clause of a third conditional sentence to talk about an <strong>imaginary or hypothetical</strong> situation in the past, and we use <strong>would have,</strong> <a href=\"/grammar-points/b1-b2/past-modal-verbs/\"><strong>could have</strong> or <strong>might have</strong></a> + <strong>past participle</strong> in the main clause<strong>&nbsp;</strong>to talk about the result or consequence of that imaginary situation.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>If you <span><strong>had come</strong></span> to class more often, you <span><strong>would have passed</strong></span> the test.</em></li> <li><em>If he <span><strong>hadn’t taken</strong></span> his helmet, he <span><strong>could have died</strong></span>.</em></li> <li><em>If the jacket <span><strong>had been</strong></span> a bit cheaper, I <strong><span>might have bought</span></strong> it.</em></li> </ul> <h4>Comma</h4> <p>As with all conditional types, we use a <strong>comma</strong> after the&nbsp;<strong>if</strong><em>–</em>clause when it goes at the beginning of the sentence, but we don’t use a comma when the&nbsp;<strong>if</strong>-clause goes at the end.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>If I <span><strong>hadn’t overslept</strong></span>, I <span><strong>wouldn’t have been</strong></span> late.</em></li> <li><em>I <span><strong>wouldn’t have been</strong></span> late if I <span><strong>hadn’t overslept</strong></span>.</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Unless</strong></h4> <p>We can also use&nbsp;<strong>unless&nbsp;</strong>in conditional sentences to mean&nbsp;<strong>if</strong>&nbsp;… (<strong>not</strong>)</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I wouldn’t have arrived on time&nbsp;<span><strong>unless</strong></span>&nbsp;I had taken a taxi.</em></li> <li><em>= I wouldn’t&nbsp;have arrived on time <span><strong>if</strong></span> I had<span><strong>n’t</strong></span>&nbsp;taken a taxi.</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":235,"questions":[{"id":1956,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If you had trained more, you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> so easily.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["didn't lose","hadn't lost","wouldn't have lost"]}]},{"id":1957,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We wouldn't have spent all the money if you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> on going to that boutique.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["hadn't insisted","didn't insist","wouldn't have insisted"]}]},{"id":1958,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If you had told me that you were having problems, I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["could have helped","would help","had helped"]}]},{"id":1959,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> that she was in town, I would have called her.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["would know","had known","would have known"]}]},{"id":1960,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If she had offered a better price for the car, I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> it.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["would buy","had bought","might have bought"]}]},{"id":1961,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>There wouldn't have been so many problems if they <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> the race a bit better.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["would have organised","organised","had organised"]}]},{"id":1962,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> lost if you had asked for directions.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["hadn't got","wouldn't get","wouldn't have got"]}]},{"id":1963,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We would never have met if you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> us to each other at that party.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["hasn't introduced","hadn't introduced","wouldn't have introduced"]}]},{"id":1964,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If she had embarrassed me in front of all my friends, I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> her for ever.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["would have hated","will hate","had hated"]}]},{"id":1965,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> her life if I had paid more attention.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["had saved","could have saved","would save"]}]}]},{"id":236,"questions":[{"id":1966,"num":"1","type":"checkbox","prompt":"<div>You ______ me if you had gone to the party. <span class=\"highlighter\">Choose TWO correct options</span></div>","maxSelections":2,"choices":[{"id":2746,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>would have seen</span>"},{"id":2747,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>could see </span>"},{"id":2748,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>might have seen</span>"}]},{"id":1967,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>What would you have done if I ______?</div>","choices":[{"id":2752,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>didn't come</span>"},{"id":2753,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>wouldn't come</span>"},{"id":2754,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>hadn't come</span>"}]},{"id":1969,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>They ______ him if I ______ them the money.</div>","choices":[{"id":2749,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>would have killed / didn't give</span>"},{"id":2750,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>would have killed / hadn't given</span>"},{"id":2751,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>had killed him / wouldn't give</span>"}]},{"id":1970,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>If I had stayed in university, I ______&nbsp;much better jobs.</div>","choices":[{"id":2758,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>will get</span>"},{"id":2759,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>had got</span>"},{"id":2760,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>could&nbsp;have got </span>"}]},{"id":1971,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>If I ______ so hard all my life, I might&nbsp;have spent more time with my kids.</div>","choices":[{"id":2761,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>hadn't worked </span>"},{"id":2762,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>wouldn't have worked</span>"},{"id":2763,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>didn't work</span>"}]},{"id":1968,"num":"6","type":"checkbox","prompt":"<div>If I had been feeling well, I ______ the steak. <span class=\"highlighter\">Choose TWO correct options</span></div>","maxSelections":2,"choices":[{"id":2755,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>might have ordered</span>"},{"id":2756,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>could have ordered</span>"},{"id":2757,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>will have ordered</span>"}]},{"id":1972,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>If I'd known you were going, I &nbsp;______ with you.</div>","choices":[{"id":2764,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>would come</span>"},{"id":2765,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>had come</span>"},{"id":2766,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>would have come </span>"}]},{"id":1973,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I ______&nbsp;the exam even if I had studied harder.</div>","choices":[{"id":2767,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>wouldn't pass</span>"},{"id":2768,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>wouldn't have passed</span>"},{"id":2769,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>hadn't passed</span>"}]},{"id":1974,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>If I ______ you the truth, you wouldn't have believed me.</div>","choices":[{"id":2770,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>told</span>"},{"id":2771,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>would have told</span>"},{"id":2772,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>had told</span>"}]},{"id":1975,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He ______ the accident if he hadn't drunk.</div>","choices":[{"id":2773,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>wouldn't have had</span>"},{"id":2774,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>wouldn't have</span>"},{"id":2775,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>hadn't had</span>"}]}]},{"id":237,"questions":[{"id":1976,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If we <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>&nbsp;(have)&nbsp;the money, we <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (go).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1977,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (tidy up)&nbsp;the house if I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (know)&nbsp;that you were coming.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1978,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (bring)&nbsp;some snacks if you <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (tell)&nbsp;us about the picnic.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1979,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Obviously, if my parents <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>&nbsp;(not meet), I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>&nbsp;(not be born).</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1980,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If he <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (invest) in that business, he <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (lose)&nbsp;everything.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1981,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If the police&nbsp;<span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (not be) nearby,&nbsp;&nbsp;there <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>&nbsp;(be) many more victims.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1982,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>What <span data-gap=\"0\"></span>&nbsp;(you/do)&nbsp;if you <span data-gap=\"1\"></span>&nbsp;(be)&nbsp;in that&nbsp;situation?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1983,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The police <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (not catch)&nbsp;him if he <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (not make)&nbsp;that little mistake.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1984,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>If I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (know)&nbsp;there was a party, I <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (wear)&nbsp;something nicer.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":1985,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>It <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (be)&nbsp;easier if you <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> (tell)&nbsp;me what I needed to do.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}